    "html": "<p>An insulated container of negligible mass contains a mass 2M of a liquid. A piece of a metal of mass M is dropped into the liquid. The temperature of the liquid increases by 10 °C and the temperature of the metal decreases by 80 °C in the same time.</p>\n<p>What is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\textit{specific heat capacity of the liquid}}{\\textit{specific heat capacity of the metal}}\"></span>?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">2</li><li data-label=\"B\">4</li><li data-label=\"C\">8</li><li data-label=\"D\">16</li></ol>"
